WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.600
Even proof checkers

00:00:01.411 --> 00:00:02.189
can be wrong

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:02.567
too

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.587
Some computer programs

00:00:04.399 --> 00:00:05.260
claim to check

00:00:05.248 --> 00:00:06.038
every step of

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.521
a proof

00:00:06.663 --> 00:00:07.948
yet reported soundness

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:08.691
bugs have let

00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:09.882
false statements slip

00:00:09.694 --> 00:00:10.507
past them

00:00:11.038 --> 00:00:12.111
Reports span the

00:00:11.922 --> 00:00:12.960
major checkers

00:00:13.102 --> 00:00:14.221
three bugs listed

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:14.929
for Mizar

00:00:15.083 --> 00:00:16.344
seven for Metamath

00:00:16.227 --> 00:00:17.028
and nine for

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:17.535
Isabelle

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:18.243
the most in

00:00:18.054 --> 00:00:18.773
the list

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.418
In many cases

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.043
the bugs were

00:00:20.855 --> 00:00:21.951
demonstrated to be

00:00:21.763 --> 00:00:22.659
exploitable

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.909
a warning against

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.170
trusting any machine

00:00:24.982 --> 00:00:26.633
verification completely

00:00:26.444 --> 00:00:27.210
blindly

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.764
Full story on

00:00:28.575 --> 00:00:29.471
the dashboard
